#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:5 3f067424058b49d7838e90b53aa9fbaa
msgid "OpenDroneID"
msgstr "OpenDroneID"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:9 06cc31fb18cf49e18d021dcdb03c9f28
msgid "Building Firmware for Production"
msgstr "构建生产用固件"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:11 155fc40656724837be750cb3551d00a4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides methods for making firmware for autopilot systems "
"integrating OpenDroneID Remote ID transmitter modules tamper-resistant as "
"well as compliant with various countries initiatives."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供了相应方法，用于为集成 OpenDroneID 远程 ID 发射模块的自动驾驶仪系统制作防篡改固件，并符合各国相关法规要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:13 d04f4ac5d97d42dab0a72edfe886789a
msgid "ArduPilot's tamper resistance currently consists of:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 当前的防篡改机制包括："

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:15 ff96a0d3ad494a1bae5301c2c3e30117
msgid ""
"Using a special board ID for ODID (OpenDroneID) firmware that will reject "
"normal attempts of loading firmware without the necessary functions and "
"parameters required for compliance. Any bootloader created with OpenDroneID "
"capabilities also has firmware checking enabled such that it will not boot "
"main firmware unless the board ids match."
msgstr ""
"为 ODID（OpenDroneID）固件使用特殊的板卡 ID，以拒绝不包含合规所需功能和参数的普通固件加载尝试。具备 OpenDroneID "
"功能的引导加载程序还启用了固件检查，使其只有在板卡 ID 匹配时才会启动主固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:16 1761b50658ff4ab481ae0f8006795996
msgid ""
"Special READONLY parameters which can be set in the firmware during the "
"compilation"
msgstr "可在编译期间在固件中设置的特殊只读参数"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:18 798ce03af50247b09272e72e0c75ba59
msgid "Future enhancements are planned."
msgstr "未来计划进行更多增强。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:20 750307f3e99e4385a5da38c71e4b0d22
msgid ""
"For an example see the hwdef and param files for an `ODID version of "
"CubeOrange "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/CubeOrange-"
"ODID>`__ with a CAN OpenDroneID module integrated on the carrier board."
msgstr ""
"示例请参见 `CubeOrange 的 ODID 版本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/CubeOrange-"
"ODID>`__ 的 hwdef 和 param 文件，该版本将 CAN OpenDroneID 模块集成在载板上。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:22 fc82ee14043d41dea16382fb71ac1ee9
msgid ""
"that the board ID has been changed different from normal firmware, to "
"prevent loading it on a remoteid equipped system by a GCS. And the DID "
"params have been set to read-only to prevent users from changing them and "
"defeating the system."
msgstr ""
"板卡 ID 已被更改为与普通固件不同，以防止地面站将其加载到配备远程 ID 的系统上。DID 参数已设置为只读，以防止用户更改它们并破坏系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:25 d27943b0d96e4a0ebae31cf5a8107831
msgid "Building Firmware for Bench Testing and Experimentation"
msgstr "构建用于台架测试和实验的固件"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:27 4bd8df5b31104a27b6df035f36ace0a8
msgid "An experimental firmware version can be built for any autopilot by:"
msgstr "可通过以下方式为任何自动驾驶仪构建实验性固件版本："

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:29 02e3a9aeebd44c599fbdf9135932234b
msgid ""
"Adding the line \"define AP_OPENDRONEID_ENABLED 1\" to its hwdef.dat file, "
"or simply building with the  waf configure option, ``--enable-opendroneid``"
msgstr ""
"在 hwdef.dat 文件中添加「define AP_OPENDRONEID_ENABLED 1」行，或直接使用 waf configure 选项 "
"``--enable-opendroneid`` 进行构建"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:30 eb64b7fa44c0487db185de2cec005c1e
msgid ""
"Any OpenDroneID capable firmware will add another tamper proofing check. An "
"OpenDroneID enabled bootloader will not run firmware with a different board "
"ID. This extends the protection already afforded by using a unique board ID "
"for OpenDroneID enabled autopilots that will reject normal attempts of "
"loading firmware without the necessary functions and parameters required for"
" compliance."
msgstr ""
"任何具备 OpenDroneID 功能的固件都将添加另一项防篡改检查。启用 OpenDroneID 的引导加载程序不会运行具有不同板卡 ID "
"的固件。这扩展了为启用 OpenDroneID 的自动驾驶仪使用唯一板卡 ID 所提供的保护，该保护将拒绝不包含合规所需功能和参数的普通固件加载尝试。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:32 355c73497f0547d2a4c846c72541d387
msgid ""
"you will need to build both the bootloader and the main firmware. Use "
"\"Tools/scripts/build_bootloaders.py BOARDNAME\" to build the bootloader "
"before reconfiguring waf and building the main firmware to include the "
"bootloader with the new board id."
msgstr ""
"您需要同时构建引导加载程序和主固件。使用「Tools/scripts/build_bootloaders.py "
"BOARDNAME」构建引导加载程序，然后重新配置 waf 并构建主固件，使其包含具有新板卡 ID 的引导加载程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:35 17ad7a324a664908901bcdd466720898
msgid "Here is a video illustrating the entire process:"
msgstr "以下是说明整个过程的视频："

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:40 cf1cdf0f1ea24a6796442b06f48516d2
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:42 4fa6d84dbfd14110a8a5a3bab53bcc5d
msgid ""
"Update MAVProxy/pymavlink to at least 1.8.54 "
"(https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.html#updating)"
msgstr ""
"将 MAVProxy/pymavlink 更新至至少 1.8.54 "
"版本（https://ardupilot.org/mavproxy/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.html#updating）"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:43 f29c739ea48d471ebc17ea90f69677f4
msgid ""
"In the directory you will be running MAVProxy from, create a remoteid.scr "
"file with this content:"
msgstr "在您将运行 MAVProxy 的目录中，创建包含以下内容的 remoteid.scr 文件："

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:65 fa32d35d38034cac96f87f85a4ae1811
msgid ""
"This sets up the required parameters a user would normally have to enter "
"into the Remote ID system from a GCS."
msgstr "这将设置用户通常需要从地面站输入到远程 ID 系统的必需参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:67 133912fb2f14434a84e62191500535a4
msgid ""
"Attach autopilot with an OpenDroneID compatible Remote ID module , `like "
"this <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__ , attached to one of its"
" serial ports to PC and start MAVProxy with the console and map with the "
"option to set the operator location to the vehicle arming location:"
msgstr ""
"将自动驾驶仪（连接有 OpenDroneID 兼容远程 ID 模块，`如此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ArduRemoteID>`__，连接到其某个串口）连接到 PC，并使用以下选项启动 "
"MAVProxy（含控制台和地图），将操作员位置设置为飞行器解锁位置："

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:73 31681e07be5f43ac96d7d5e8e146fcd7
msgid ""
"this may not be legal in some jurisdictions in actual use, but the "
"OpenDroneID module firmware will reject this assignment with a suitable "
"build option set in its firmware for those jurisdictions. This allows "
"testing on PCs without a GPS attached to determine operator location."
msgstr ""
"在某些司法管辖区的实际使用中，这可能不合法，但 OpenDroneID "
"模块固件将通过在其固件中为这些司法管辖区设置合适的构建选项来拒绝此分配。这允许在没有连接 GPS 的 PC 上进行测试以确定操作员位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:75 2a127c3f008347899b33380713949d66
msgid ""
"Make sure the autopilot serial port that the module is attached is setup for"
" 57.6K and MAVLink2 if using serial interconnect. If using DroneCAN, then "
"make sure the CAN parameters are enabled appropriately."
msgstr ""
"如果使用串行互连，请确保模块连接的自动驾驶仪串口已设置为 57.6K 和 MAVLink2。如果使用 DroneCAN，请确保 CAN 参数已正确启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:76 f5067c2d9bf14f5daf3cd4eafc5cb86a
msgid ""
"Run the 'script remoteid.scr' command to load the script...you should see it"
" announce that it has loaded the OpenDroneID module and other commands in "
"the console"
msgstr "运行「script remoteid.scr」命令加载脚本……您应该能在控制台看到它宣告已加载 OpenDroneID 模块及其他命令。"

