#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:123 3579fc9c3de34b7bb7cea5e986c36f5b
msgid "Using Mission Planner as the GCS"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 作为地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/opendroneid.rst:125 8d4fcf89daa94ddd8b39a5cfff238942
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has a special Drone ID tab in its DATA view for use with "
"OpenDroneID modules attached to the autopilot which allows monitoring "
"status, attaching the required GPS for operator location of the GCS, and UAS"
" and Operator ID string setup. See :ref:`planner:opendroneid`."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的数据视图中有一个专用的 Drone ID 标签页，用于与连接到自动驾驶仪的 OpenDroneID "
"模块配合使用，允许监控状态、连接地面站操作员位置所需的 GPS，以及设置 UAS 和操作员 ID 字符串。参见 "
":ref:`planner:opendroneid`。"
